diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 3528ad0..f078a19 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
 - `Inventory.on_hand()` now returns the quantity at each location; the new `Inventory.total()` returns the sum.
 - `Inventory.receive()`, `issue()`, `transfer()` and `adjust()` return the `seq` of the movement they record.
 - Log movements in the data file as lines with one `location` and a signed `delta`; a transfer is two lines sharing its `seq`. Data file version 3; older files are upgraded when read.
+- Locations can have a capacity (`add-location --capacity N`); a receive or transfer that would exceed it is refused.
 
 ## 1.4.0
 
